description: Requirements for using tools
alwaysApply: true
globs: []
---

NEVER batch search/recall tools in parallel for tools of the same mcp instance.

MANDATORY always use consequent progressive disclosure in <prefix>_search() and recall():
* detail_level="L0" for initial broadly scoped scanning and following recovery hints
* L1 for elaborating topics by more precise queries
* L2 for exact content - code, configs, full procedures - of a best match by a most precise query

MANDATORY always stop any context retrieval and tools calling loops after 5 attempts
for each call/tool type inside of a single instance of prompt, thinking process, subagent